{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_007_fkl_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_007_fkl_02_synopsis", "source_sha256": "8ea7c04a1890c244456b9bacb383c7f57b73a6174c84e844f038d02f41729130", "ja": "――これは、人とヴァンパイアを巡る物語。\n「今すぐ、選んでください。ここで死ぬか\n……もう二度と、死ねない身体になるか」", "zh": "──这是人与吸血鬼之间的故事。\n「请你立刻选择吧。你要现在死去……\n还是要成为不死之身。」", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_007_fkl_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_007_fkl_02_1000_031tom", "source_sha256": "667d2375d9070be354fe00bf514ce16660b1fb1dff944032c9a8a0f1f29ee96d", "ja": "目を閉じていてください、エドガー。少し、苦しいかも\nしれませんが……貴方ならきっと耐えられると、……。", "zh": "请闭上眼睛，埃德加。虽然可能会有些痛苦……\n但我相信，你一定能承受得住……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_007_fkl_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_007_fkl_02_1001_020meg", "source_sha256": "eda8d38805c2341cbd4b6a5ad9d264ef633276c6a8798688035e20d6fca2a923", "ja": "……クリス……なに……？", "zh": "……克里斯……怎么了……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_007_fkl_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_007_fkl_02_1002_020meg", "source_sha256": "c26b494a455baa350cc982fd5b7304651cdf7738f61cc6b016c12bbf60adde40", "ja": "あっ……なぁ、アンタ！　そっちは、行き止まり……。", "zh": "啊……喂，你！那边是死胡同……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_007_fkl_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_007_fkl_02_1003_031tom", "source_sha256": "c17b1fa7087e01f72128caf0af4a336da7ca8871e9901795da54963b3b41275d", "ja": "私に、何か用事ですか～？", "zh": "找我有什么事吗～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_007_fkl_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_007_fkl_02_1004_046rio", "source_sha256": "3f836692a8291b67aa181a34d253f9cf23540ef76120222ac6edbfc524e694ba", "ja": "ヴァンパイア討伐には、もちろん卿にも参加していた\nだくわ。不浄な怪物どもを討ち滅ぼす、英雄として、ね", "zh": "讨伐吸血鬼，卿当然也得参加。\n作为讨灭不洁怪物们的英雄，对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_007_fkl_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_007_fkl_02_1005_038chz", "source_sha256": "6647e00d06d19ed495674abe89c451f65813ca709fe29cabc273c3f630fdf4d1", "ja": "不浄な怪物だと？", "zh": "你说不净的怪物？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_007_fkl_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_007_fkl_02_1006_046rio", "source_sha256": "120fc823866fc45e6c871c6801ba44518db24c8fd71a00fb22f96a2602e0e4ee", "ja": "貴方の妹君……ノエルも、\n今では人の血を吸う化け物よねぇ。", "zh": "你那位令妹……诺艾尔，\n如今也是吸食人血的怪物了呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_007_fkl_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_007_fkl_02_1007_020meg", "source_sha256": "2fa5dff44a9b5d270bb0c6c145348b88b01be68adc38417761e6a3f9798fb671", "ja": "オレたちは生きたい！……ヴァンパイアだって、\n幸せになっていいはずだ！", "zh": "我们想活下去！……就算是吸血鬼，\n也应该有资格获得幸福！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_007_fkl_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_007_fkl_02_1008_038chz", "source_sha256": "d78508bb25b0fd774872a05026dd38e41d14617fc04e16f5724157e8d45a90b2", "ja": "ヴァンパイアが……幸せに……？", "zh": "吸血鬼……获得幸福……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_007_fkl_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_007_fkl_02_1009_038chz", "source_sha256": "dfb1a01ad79be507de0f217d73cd82cb28d8d243eaf0fc3189fda15650c89f3e", "ja": "幸せに……ノエル。……ああ……。", "zh": "获得幸福……诺艾儿……啊啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_007_fkl_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_007_fkl_02_1010_038chz", "source_sha256": "afa4dfdc1f1881c11f9050819be1f1534f3455fd0e63f048f72bc0f6d692113b", "ja": "そのような甘言に、誰が乗せられるものか！\n――滅びるがいい、ヴァンパイア！", "zh": "谁会上这种甜言蜜语的当！\n——毁灭吧，吸血鬼！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
